.TH CERT\-GEN 1 "2026-10-29" "unheaded b06c570c" "Unheaded Kingdom"
.SH NAME
cert\-gen \- Generate TLS certificates for the Unheaded service mesh.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B cert\-gen
[\fIOPTION\fR]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Generate TLS certificates for the Unheaded service mesh.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-layout \fISTRING\fR
flat (<out>/<svc>.pem) or per\-service (<out>/<svc>/<svc>.pem + ca.pem) (default flat)
.TP
.B \-\-out \fISTRING\fR
Output directory for certificates (default ./certs)
.TP
.B \-\-reuse\-ca
keep an existing <out>/ca.pem + ca\-key.pem instead of making a new CA
.TP
.B \-\-services \fISTRING\fR
Comma\-separated service names (default: all)
.TP
.B \-\-ttl \fIDURATION\fR
Certificate TTL (default 24h0m0s)
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
display this help and exit
.TP
.B \-V, \-\-version
output version information and exit
.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
cert\-gen \-out /etc/unheaded/certs
.EE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR unheaded (1)
